  "post_title": "Inaugurada en Onda la exposición de fotos del Concurso Nacional L'Art de la Llum",
  "post_date": "2012-05-25 18:18:52",
  "post_name": "inaugurada-en-onda-la-exposicion-de-fotos-del-concurso-nacional-lart-de-la-llum",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>El Local de Asociaciones de Onda acoge desde esta tarde hasta el domingo 3 de junio la exposici&oacute;n del XIX Concurso Nacional de Fotograf&iacute;a &quot;L&#39;Art de la Llum&quot;, <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=28673\" target=\"_blank\">cuyo fallo se dio a conocer el d&iacute;a 13 de mayo</a>.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/05/IMG_8040.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>En el acto de inauguraci&oacute;n, al que ha asistido una amplia representaci&oacute;n del Ayuntamiento de Onda y de componentes de la agrupaci&oacute;n fotogr&aacute;fica L&#39;Art de la Llum, han intervenido su vicepresidente y su presidente, Pascual Bort y Antonio Garc&iacute;a Badenes, respectivamente, y el teniente de alcalde de Desarrollo Econ&oacute;mico, Ram&oacute;n Sebasti&aacute;n, que ha excusado la ausencia del alcalde, Salvador Aguilella, y de la teniente de alcalde de Cultura, Mar&iacute;a Dolores Feliu.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotosconcursartllum/img_8040.jpg\" alt=\"img_8040\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotosconcursartllum/img_8041.jpg\" alt=\"img_8041\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotosconcursartllum/img_8042.jpg\" alt=\"img_8042\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotosconcursartllum/img_8043.jpg\" alt=\"img_8043\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotosconcursartllum/img_8044.jpg\" alt=\"img_8044\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotosconcursartllum/img_8045.jpg\" alt=\"img_8045\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotosconcursartllum/img_8046.jpg\" alt=\"img_8046\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotosconcursartllum/img_8047.jpg\" alt=\"img_8047\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotosconcursartllum/img_8048.jpg\" alt=\"img_8048\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotosconcursartllum/img_8049.jpg\" alt=\"img_8049\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotosconcursartllum/img_8050.jpg\" alt=\"img_8050\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotosconcursartllum/img_8051.jpg\" alt=\"img_8051\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotosconcursartllum/img_8052.jpg\" alt=\"img_8052\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotosconcursartllum/img_8053.jpg\" alt=\"img_8053\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotosconcursartllum/img_8054.jpg\" alt=\"img_8054\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotosconcursartllum/img_8055.jpg\" alt=\"img_8055\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
